<p>After his appearance in an episode of Gilligan's Island, he would find steady work as a television guest star including multiple episodes of Bonanza, Barney Miller, Bewitched, I Dream of Jeannie, Starsky and Hutch plus others. He also had a reoccuring role in for several months in 1969 in the daytime drama (i.e. "soap opera") General Hospital. In all, he is credited with over 100 television appearances. Peterson in "I Dream of Jeannie"</p>

<div class="image-gallery">
  <figure>
    <img src="/assets/images/biographies/arthur-h-peterson-jr/282-peterson-arthur-portrait.jpg" alt="Historic image from the Arthur H. Peterson, Jr. (1912-1996) page">
